- Automated workflows generate bilingual reports (`seo-audit/daily-report-YYYY-MM-DD-fa-en.md`) and push them to mobile notification channels (ntfy / Telegram / WhatsApp / GitHub Mobile Issues) so the owner can monitor and interact from their phone at any time.
